{"concept_id":"rag-permission-filter","content_sha256":"sha256:df9d35086ad621a502facf5a6e68c08000640e98eec2fcbaef5c48ea038294af","correct_option_ids":["a"],"domain":"ml-system-design","explanation":"未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文，否则生成阶段可能泄露，即使最终文本过滤也不可靠。","id":"q-company-rag-permission-filter-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"检索候选和上下文构造阶段都要遵守用户权限，不能只在生成后过滤"},{"id":"b","text":"只在回答文本生成后做字符串过滤"},{"id":"c","text":"只依赖向量相似度"},{"id":"d","text":"权限过滤会降低安全性"}],"prompt":"企业 RAG 检索链路中，权限过滤应放在什么位置？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"safety","source_refs":[{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"ML System Design interview topic synthesis","url":"https://www.deep-ml.com/interview-prep/ml-system-design-general?role=ml-system-design"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"rag","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
